flowchart TD
 E[Conversation and tool event] --> X[Candidate extractor]
 X --> P{Consent, purpose and scope policy}
 P -->|approved| DB[(Tenant-scoped memory store)]
 P -->|rejected| R[Discard with reason]
 Q[Current request + authenticated scope] --> F[Authorization and TTL filter]
 DB --> F
 F --> S[Relevance, reliability and recency ranker]
 S --> B[Token-budgeted context assembler]
 B --> L[Agent inference with source IDs]
 DB --> T[TTL and deletion worker]
 T --> D[Delete source, summaries, embeddings and caches]
